@title Cabinet Routes panel: warnings are count chips with a fix button
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Workflow gap row 3. After Route all the right pane shows one row of chips ("N no size [Size them]", "N no entry [Set entry]") instead of orange sentences; the sentence is behind the "?".
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
expect "Set entry"
expect "Detect pins"
shot chips
check_layout
click_text "Set entry"
wait 20
shot entry-set
check_layout
